      "notes": "MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) benchmark on unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-GGUF IQ4_XS. Full grid search of 16 configs (n_max: 2/4/6/8/16 \u00d7 p_min: 0.35/0.50/0.75 + baseline). Best: --spec-draft-n-max 2 --spec-draft-p-min 0.50 at 40.8 tok/s (1.47x vs 27.8 baseline no-MTP). n_max=16 was slower than baseline (27.0 tok/s). llama.cpp upstream PR #22673, am17an/mtp branch. Server restarted between each config. 256 output tokens, single request, temperature=1.0 (non-greedy). MTP acceptance rate ~75% at n_max=2. Build commit: upstream llama.cpp from mid-May 2026.",
